r fallback cannot find the only part that exports _KNOWN_ACTIONS.\n- Files: _reality_ledger_parts/audit_actions.py:41-116.\n- _audit_emit_parts/actions.py:10-12 is the only part that exports _KNOWN_ACTIONS, and \"actions\" is not in the facade's install roster (audit_emit.py:415-452). actions.py, actions_core.py and actions_extended.py have no importer, so they form a second action registry that can drift from the live literal.\n- Scenario: if _KNOWN_ACTIONS is moved into actions.py, detector #6 reads an empty set and flags every emitted action as phantom. That failure is loud and advisory, not silent.\n- Fix: add a fixture test for the fallback, and either delete the dead registry or add it to the roster.\n\nP2-6 (new, cosmetic): stale evidence text.\n- File: _reality_ledger_parts/environment.py:210-214.\n- The expected_evidence string still lists the old exclusion set, without /staging/ or /_reality_ledger_parts/.","decision":"GO","sentence":"Conditions 3(c), 5, 7 and 8 hold against this payload's code and the moved spool_writer and reality-ledger code keeps its bindings, defaults, patch points and fail-open direction; I found no P0 and no undeclared P1, and the one P1 that still reproduces is already declared in the carried lane notes, leaving only P2 follow-ups."},"ttft_ms":10637,"type":"result","duration_ms":713706,"uuid":"c67432bc-130c-4832-89bd-bcf0f3006a03","ttft_stream_ms":8418,"time_to_request_ms":277,"first_content_frame_ms":8418,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":132,"outputTokens":57812,"cacheReadInputTokens":12445853,"cacheCreationInputTokens":263863,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":5.756842600000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":39348,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":263863,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-20T15:54:23.997Z"}
